==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Typhlosion|185}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Fire Breath''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared as a {{TCG|Poké-Power}} on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Dark Houndoom|37}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*'''Magma Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Wizards Promo|Magmar|44}}, one of the {{TCG|Wizards Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

